message: "If you use this code or the released per-slice decisions, please cite the paper."
title: "Answer or Defer? Testing VLMs' Stated Confidence on Brain MRI"
abstract: >-
  Research code for a study of whether the confidence a vision-language model
  states alongside its answer can serve as a deferral gate on brain MRI, and of
  what makes it fail when it cannot.
